t</span> <span begin="27.736" end="28.241">like</span> <span begin="28.341" end="29.668">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">就像你一样</span></p><p begin="29.978" end="31.683" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.978" end="30.153">For</span> <span begin="30.153" end="30.743">how</span> <span begin="30.743" end="31.683">long</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">还要多久</span></p><p begin="31.952" end="33.927" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.952" end="32.197">For</span> <span begin="32.197" end="32.717">how</span> <span begin="32.717" end="33.927">long</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">还要多久</span></p><p begin="33.927" end="35.047" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.927" end="34.197">Must</span> <span begin="34.197" end="34.422">I</span> <span begin="34.422" end="35.047">wait</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我必须等待</span></p><p begin="35.047" end="38.410" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.047" end="35.513">I</span> <span begin="35.619" end="36.174">know</span> <span begin="36.174" end="36.769">there&apos;s</span> <span begin="36.769" end="37.265">some</span><span begin="37.265" end="37.780">thing</span> <span begin="37.809" end="38.410">wrong</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我知道有些不对劲</span></p><p begin="38.980" end="42.550" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.980" end="39.063">Your</span> <span begin="39.177" end="39.467">con</span><span begin="39.467" end="40.020">crete</span> <span begin="40.020" end="40.665">heart</span> <span begin="40.665" end="40.985">is</span><span begin="40.985" end="41.215">n&apos;t</span> <span begin="41.215" end="41.785">beat</span><span begin="41.785" end="42.550">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你那混凝土般的心脏 不再跳动</span></p><p begin="42.930" end="44.821" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.930" end="43.176">And</span> <span begin="43.176" end="43.389">you</span> <span begin="43.389" end="43.879">tried</span> <span begin="44.017" end="44.821">to</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而你曾试图</span></p><p begin="45.124" end="47.510" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.124" end="45.409">Make</span> <span begin="45.409" end="45.529">it</span> <span begin="45.687" end="46.243">come</span> <span begin="46.243" end="47.510">alive</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">让它重获生机</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="47.510" end="47.928"><span begin="47.510" end="47.928">(-live)</span></span></p><p begin="47.928" end="49.774" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.928" end="48.044">No</span> <span begin="48.044" end="48.804">shad</span><span begin="48.804" end="49.774">ows</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">没有阴影</span></p><p begin="49.914" end="51.760" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.914" end="50.190">Just</span> <span begin="50.190" end="50.480">red</span> <span begin="50.480" end="51.760">lights</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只有无数的监视</span></p><p begin="51.900" end="58.731" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.900" end="52.200">Now</span> <span begin="52.200" end="52.485">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="52.485" end="53.065">here</span> <span begin="53.065" end="53.460">to</span> <span begin="53.460" end="54.045">res</span><span begin="54.109" end="54.636">cue</span> <span begin="54.636" end="58.731">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">现在我来拯救你</span></p><p begin="1:04.217" end="1:07.502" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.217" end="1:05.094">Oh</span> <span begin="1:05.094" end="1:05.684">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:05.684" end="1:06.179">still</span> <span begin="1:06.179" end="1:07.502">alive</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">哦 我还活着</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:06.885" end="1:07.783"><span begin="1:06.885" end="1:07.298">(Still</span> <span begin="1:07.298" end="1:07.783">alive)</span></span></p><p begin="1:07.856" end="1:10.097" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.856" end="1:07.961">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:07.961" end="1:08.732">still</span> <span begin="1:08.732" end="1:10.005">alive</span> <span begin="1:10.005" end="1:10.097">and</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我还活着 而且</span></p><p begin="1:10.097" end="1:15.376" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.097" end="1:10.247">I</span> <span begin="1:10.352" end="1:10.944">can&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:10.944" end="1:12.079">apol</span><span begin="1:12.079" end="1:12.566">o</span><span begin="1:12.566" end="1:13.184">gise,</span> <span begin="1:13.184" end="1:15.376">no</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我不会道歉， 不</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:14.501" end="1:15.450"><span begin="1:14.501" end="1:15.450">(Ohhh)</span></span></p><p begin="1:22.154" end="1:25.434" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.154" end="1:23.299">Oh</span> <span begin="1:23.299" end="1:23.649">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:23.649" end="1:24.129">still</span> <span begin="1:24.129" end="1:25.434">alive</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">哦 我还活着</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:24.851" end="1:25.736"><span begin="1:24.851" end="1:25.226">(Still</span> <span begin="1:25.226" end="1:25.736">alive)</span></span></p><p begin="1:25.801" end="1:28.025" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.801" end="1:25.913">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:25.913" end="1:26.668">still</span> <span begin="1:26.668" end="1:27.790">alive</span> <span begin="1:27.790" end="1:28.025">and</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我还活着 而且</span></p><p begin="1:28.025" end="1:32.325" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.025" end="1:28.135">I</span> <span begin="1:28.301" end="1:28.901">can&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:28.901" end="1:30.016">apol</span><span begin="1:30.016" end="1:30.456">o</span><span begin="1:30.514" end="1:31.152">gise,</span> <span begin="1:31.152" end="1:32.325">no</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我不会道歉， 不</span></p><p begin="1:32.325" end="1:34.259" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.325" end="1:32.590">So</span> <span begin="1:32.590" end="1:34.259">silent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如此沉寂</span></p><p begin="1:34.671" end="1:36.509" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.671" end="1:35.015">No</span> <span begin="1:35.015" end="1:35.283">vi</span><span begin="1:35.283" end="1:35.448">o</span><span begin="1:35.448" end="1:36.509">lence</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">没有暴力</span></p><p begin="1:36.764" end="1:39.107" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:36.764" end="1:36.908">But</span> <span begin="1:36.908" end="1:37.121">in</span><span begin="1:37.121" end="1:37.786">side</span> <span begin="1:37.786" end="1:38.341">my</span> <span begin="1:38.341" end="1:39.107">head</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但在我脑海深处</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:37.130" end="1:38.821"><span begin="1:37.130" end="1:37.800">((in)side</span> <span begin="1:37.800" end="1:38.456">my</span> <span begin="1:38.456" end="1:38.821">head)</span></span></p><p begin="1:39.413" end="1:41.443" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.413" end="1:39.773">So</span> <span begin="1:39.773" end="1:40.192">loud</span> <span begin="1:40.192" end="1:40.613">and</span> <span begin="1:40.613" end="1:41.443">clear</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如此清晰响亮</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:39.413" end="1:41.443"><span begin="1:39.413" end="1:39.773">(So</span> <span begin="1:39.773" end="1:40.192">loud</span> <span begin="1:40.192" end="1:40.613">and</span> <span begin="1:40.613" end="1:41.443">clear)</span></span></p><p begin="1:41.778" end="1:43.211" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:41.778" end="1:41.915">You&apos;re</span> <span begin="1:41.915" end="1:42.666">scream</span><span begin="1:42.666" end="1:43.211">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你在怒吼</span></p><p begin="1:43.779" end="1:45.536" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.779" end="1:43.864">You&apos;re</span> <span begin="1:43.864" end="1:44.578">scream</span><span begin="1:44.578" end="1:45.536">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你在怒吼</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:43.864" end="1:45.536"><span begin="1:43.864" end="1:44.578">(Scream</span><span begin="1:44.578" end="1:45.536">ing)</span></span></p><p begin="1:45.626" end="1:50.028" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.626" end="1:45.994">Cov</span><span begin="1:45.994" end="1:46.254">er</span> <span begin="1:46.254" end="1:46.549">up</span> <span begin="1:46.783" end="1:47.111">with</span> <span begin="1:47.111" end="1:47.191">a</span> <span begin="1:47.191" end="1:47.986">smile</span> <span begin="1:47.986" end="1:48.533">I&apos;ve</span> <span begin="1:48.533" end="1:49.063">learned</span> <span begin="1:49.063" end="1:49.443">to</span> <span begin="1:49.443" end="1:50.028">fear</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">用我学会恐惧的微笑来掩饰</span></p><p begin="1:50.728" end="1:54.410" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.728" end="1:50.799">Just</span> <span begin="1:50.799" end="1:51.377">sun</span><span begin="1:51.377" end="1:52.507">shine,</span> <span begin="1:52.652" end="1:52.809">and</span> <span begin="1:52.950" end="1:53.270">blue</span> <span begin="1:53.270" end="1:54.410">skies</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只有阳光，和蓝天</span></p><p begin="1:54.706" end="1:59.443" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:54.706" end="1:54.937">Is</span> <span begin="1:54.937" end="1:55.222">this</span> <span begin="1:55.222" end="1:55.484">all</span> <span begin="1:55.484" end="1:55.654">we</span> <span begin="1:55.791" end="1:56.429">get,</span> <span begin="1:57.394" end="1:57.728">for</span> <span begin="1:57.728" end="1:58.018">liv</span><span begin="1:58.018" end="1:58.528">ing</span> <span begin="1:58.528" end="1:59.443">here?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在这活着所能得到的一切吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:55.797" end="1:57.708"><span begin="1:55.797" end="1:56.129">(Is</span> <span begin="1:56.129" end="1:56.423">This</span> <span begin="1:56.423" end="1:56.654">all</span> <span begin="1:56.654" end="1:56.924">we</span> <span begin="1:56.924" end="1:57.708">get)</span></span></p><p begin="1:59.704" end="2:01.270" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.704" end="1:59.826">Come</span> <span begin="1:59.826" end="2:01.270">fire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">来吧</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:00.553" end="2:01.619"><span begin="2:00.553" end="2:01.619">(Fire)</span></span></p><p begin="2:01.674" end="2:03.573" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.674" end="2:01.807">Come</span> <span begin="2:01.807" end="2:03.573">fire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">来吧</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:01.807" end="2:03.573"><span begin="2:01.807" end="2:03.573">(Fire)</span></span></p><p begin="2:03.573" end="2:10.465" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:03.573" end="2:03.918">Let</span> <span begin="2:03.918" end="2:04.047">it</span> <span begin="2:04.182" end="2:04.752">burn</span> <span begin="2:04.752" end="2:05.109">and</span> <span begin="2:05.109" end="2:05.869">love</span> <span begin="2:05.869" end="2:06.424">come</span> <span begin="2:06.424" end="2:06.859">rac</span><span begin="2:06.859" end="2:07.534">ing</span> <span begin="2:07.534" end="2:10.465">through</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">让爱燃烧，让爱奔腾而至</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:03.573" end="2:09.905"><span begin="2:03.573" end="2:03.918">(Let</span> <span begin="2:03.918" end="2: